## 3. Modified Files

### `forensic-engine/engine.py` — Major Rewrite

**New Elasticsearch query functions:**

| Function | What it does |
|---|---|
| `_query_cowrie_sessions()` | Renamed from `_query_sessions()`. Added `success_count` + `failed_count` sub-aggs |
| `_query_dionaea_sessions()` | NEW — aggregates Dionaea events by source IP + destination port |
| `_query_galah_sessions()` | NEW — aggregates Galah HTTP events, extracts top-20 `http_paths` per IP |
| `_query_cowrie_commands()` | NEW — fetches up to 50 shell commands per Cowrie session from ES |

**`run_session_scoring()` changes:**
- Queries all 3 honeypots (Cowrie + Dionaea + Galah) and merges into `all_sessions`
- Builds rich `session_data` dict (30+ fields): reputation, privacy, geo, Shodan, malware, time metrics, SMB profiles, multi-honeypot correlation
- Replaces old `OllamaMitreMapper.map_session(session_data, commands=..., http_paths=...)` with new `MitreMapper.map_session(session_data)` — commands/http_paths now passed inside `session_data`
- Extracts and stores 4 new fields per session: `kill_chain_phase`, `kill_chain_stage`, `primary_technique`, `forensic_narrative`

**`_save_session()` — 4 new columns added to INSERT:**
```sql
kill_chain_phase, kill_chain_stage, primary_technique, forensic_narrative
```
Also added to `ON CONFLICT DO UPDATE` clause.

**Import change:** `from mitre_mapper import MitreMapper`
**New CLI flag:** `--score-only` (skips enrichment + YARA, runs scoring immediately)

