## 4. Live PostgreSQL Migration

Applied to `forenhive-postgresql` on 2026-04-12:
```bash
docker exec forenhive-postgresql psql -U forenhive -d forenhive -c \
  "ALTER TABLE forensic_sessions ADD COLUMN IF NOT EXISTS kill_chain_phase VARCHAR(50);"
# (repeated for all 4 columns)
```
Result: `forensic_sessions` now has 13 columns. 

**Recurring issue:** PostgreSQL container restart resets the user password (Docker volume behavior).
Fix required after each container recreate:
```bash
docker exec forenhive-postgresql psql -U forenhive -c \
  "ALTER USER forenhive PASSWORD 'forenhive2026';"
```

