## 6. Architecture Decisions

| Decision | Rationale |
|---|---|
| Hybrid MITRE (deterministic IDs + LLM narrative) | Full LLM invented invalid technique IDs under Mistral 7B |
| 80-token narrative prompt | 4× faster on CPU-only server (Dell R750, no GPU) |
| `llm_used = True` only on actual LLM success | Previously flagged True even on timeout — misleading logs |
| `kill_chain_completed = stage >= 5` | Stage 5+ means attacker achieved persistence or beyond |
| `PRIVATE_VPN_RANGES` via env var | 10.212.0.0/16 is the lab Kali VPN subnet, not Docker |
| Single forensic-engine run at a time | Two concurrent containers compete for Ollama CPU → timeouts |

