## 7. Known Issues

| Issue | Impact | Workaround |
|---|---|---|
| Mistral 7B CPU inference sometimes >60s | Narrative falls back to deterministic template; technique IDs unaffected | Run one forensic-engine at a time |
| PostgreSQL password reset on container recreate | `_save_session()` fails auth | `ALTER USER forenhive PASSWORD 'forenhive2026'` after each recreate |
| `kill_chain_phase` NULL for rows scored before migration | Old rows have NULL in new columns | Rows backfill on next `ON CONFLICT DO UPDATE` run |
